==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*6 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*3 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**5 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 34.67 seconds<sup>1,040f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The only real threats here are the Aku Gories. Any attacker like [[Pizza Cat]] or [[Can Can Cat]] should be able to deal with them.

